Addresses the MMU gave for the two module partitions, read from the watch at
/root/modaddr.txt (written by modload_prepare() at every boot).

Refresh with:

    esptool read_flash 0x620000 0x7E0000 /tmp/st.img
    littlefs-python: open /root/modaddr.txt

MODDATA_AT must be right: it is the link address of every module's .rodata, and a
stale value faults on the first constant read.
